e!<br></li><li>Boss fights too!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bite Sized Levels</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 60 levels<br></li><li>Each is designed to offer a challenge in just a few minutes</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225430/extras/d03f75eec1cf18a690433acab4076e7c.poster.avif?t=1728014805\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225430/extras/d03f75eec1cf18a690433acab4076e7c.webm?t=1728014805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225430/extras/d03f75eec1cf18a690433acab4076e7c.mp4?t=1728014805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlockable Costumes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Complete achievements to unlock 6 unique costumes<br></li><li>Including Classic V, Jungle Fighter V, Reaper V, and more!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Hunt a plethora of monsters using unique items in a dynamic turn-based grid puzzler! Complete the bite-sized levels in as few turns as possible and help V-Hunter defeat the evil vampire Alric!",
